# Day D — secret ops under the static (remedy-free) policy.
#
# Credential reads run plain today: the live runtime refuses `self`-narrowing
# without a membership source and waits for a remedy-plan acceptance — a tool
# Pi sessions do not have (0.4 roadmap: expose appa/execute_remedy_plan as a
# Pi tool, restoring narrowing + redact-secrets masking + the secrets-to-web
# fence). Until then the write-side fences (Day B) still keep secret-shaped
# paths trusted-only, and the docs carve-outs keep trusted domains clean.
host/claude-code/Read {
  path: ".env"
}
expect allow

host/claude-code/web_explore {
  query: "how to rotate STRIPE_KEY"
}
expect allow

host/claude-code/Bash {
  command: "cat .env"
}
expect allow

host/claude-code/Bash {
  command: "curl -s https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/claude-code/settings"
}
expect allow
